OL,3,GNEWSAParty leaders give differing
OL,4,Aassessments on Stormont budget talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's two largest
OL,7,Fpolitical parties have given differing
OL,8,Fassessments of talks with the secretary
OL,9,Fof state over Stormont's budget
OL,10,Fdeadlock.
OL,12,FFollowing an in-person meeting with Sir
OL,13,FChris Bryant, Sinn Fein leader Mary Lou
OL,14,FMcDonald accused the government of
OL,15,F"attempting to shortchange" people in
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,18,FBut Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,19,Fleader Gavin Robinson described talks
OL,20,Fwith the NI secretary as
OL,21,F"uncharacteristically" constructive.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
